{"version":1,"key":"card:630","content":{"id":630,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"82c189b3-95a8-4cd3-a60c-bfe37343c510","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"学习到两个有用的概念："}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","tauContract":"b74d37e5bfbf2503c151b31f93763a8fb42e80426564246cbb0af72201a60e8c","collabId":"e667c5b7-4ef7-4c92-a40c-71f1c30ac26c","children":[{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"cb6a711d-43ce-4840-8a6f-0d18bb607bc3","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"eb97658b-f4e4-48f3-bb10-89f6683b5f5f","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"认知过载，人在短时间内接受过量信息从而无法进行有效思考"}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","tauContract":"b74d37e5bfbf2503c151b31f93763a8fb42e80426564246cbb0af72201a60e8c","collabId":"0dfbb0c5-80c4-455e-95b4-1b278b7655c8","children":[{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"87cfd074-a116-470e-a856-ba1a2de5f6d9","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"7f6567f8-b99d-48b0-8ee7-bedcc147b188","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"老师快速讲述过多知识点"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"1ddf5d85-6257-47af-a3b1-cfe1c18098ed","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"34386649-7575-4ad6-9431-6cdcb17b4020","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"短时间内读完一本书"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"42eaa902-08c9-462f-964d-1a8ec214fbe2","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"给我带来的启示是不要求在一周或者几周内快速读完一本书，这也与我的实际体验相符，快速读完无法消化书里面的内容，读书更重要的是专注，当读的时间长了，就无法保持专注了，阅读体验及效率大幅降低，学会让自己从中脱离出来，敬酒虽好，可不要贪杯！"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"8e082a03-1829-400d-9773-58db9fa5a20d","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"1b5dd896-be6e-4fae-abf0-ccc596b0e9a5","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"重复抑制，有效的学习来自于激活神经元，但是重复激活同一神经元，会导致神经元敏度感降低，再次重复时会使得神经元不再被激活，新的连接不再被建立，从而导致无效学习。解决办法："}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","tauContract":"b74d37e5bfbf2503c151b31f93763a8fb42e80426564246cbb0af72201a60e8c","collabId":"ba0f73d2-3602-4095-b036-03507407b089","children":[{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"78a4fcfd-a525-4200-b931-a80ebd5b67c0","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"9f41a749-c103-410a-ac14-3c05d94f1f9a","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"间隔复习法，根据某些算法，如  "},{"type":"link","url":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/ZjJ-3MC5MUG9W8MtihPaew","openEdit":false,"tauContract":"ebf1d56e356279ad64279a16e90d9b28280f70eac20d5071950fc0c4b5c364a6","collabId":"01a135cf-127b-4182-b412-60f0431f108e","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"FSRS 算法 "}]},{"type":"formatted","text":" 来设计复习间隔"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"941dc948-2613-4b15-ae13-1ee67e3f0575","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"e73c0d0b-728c-4092-a0b3-760be76b3f91","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"穿插式学习，同一时间手中有多个项目进行，如阅读多本书，同样是在 3 个月的时间读完三本书，与其一个月依次读完一本，不如穿插式 3 个月交替阅读三本，把战线拉长"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"c687583c-2c70-41cc-a58c-920b22cd12fe","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"穿插式学习很符合我的心意，主要反而不是在于把战线拉长，而是如果事情是一件一件的去完成，在完成上一件事情后，我经常拖延不肯开始下一件事情，而同时并行会极大的减少拖延的时间；另外并行的另一个好处是，总有一个项目没有兴趣或存在卡点的情况，可能存在很长一段时间没有进展，如果这个时候有另一个（或几个）项目，就可以切到别的项目，换一换脑子，很有可能过了一段时间对原项目产生了兴趣或者有了思路，人就是这样，喜新厌旧，这样很符合人性"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"d8b5306a-a28c-4b63-a03a-d8b5c915da15","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"参考："}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","tauContract":"b74d37e5bfbf2503c151b31f93763a8fb42e80426564246cbb0af72201a60e8c","collabId":"8d2b3ac4-6cc2-4a27-8afa-1b595a81676a","children":[{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"c3163017-8ae2-46e5-a426-7d567cb382e3","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"336a201e-7ae1-40d1-a189-275fb9b5cfce","children":[{"type":"link","url":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/9_C0p_PLsNViI-UFf8bupQ","openEdit":false,"tauContract":"ebf1d56e356279ad64279a16e90d9b28280f70eac20d5071950fc0c4b5c364a6","collabId":"bec7eaba-f433-42bb-94c9-c2c3cb211bb9","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"自学的两个大坑：认知过载和理论过载｜学习骇客"}]}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"ca016d22-6324-44c5-b1db-b3890463bb2a","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"3f34c01f-3b0c-49c0-ad2a-6821a158e18e","children":[{"type":"link","url":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/JO7z5s_67Ulw8_3Ma6KMdw","openEdit":false,"tauContract":"ebf1d56e356279ad64279a16e90d9b28280f70eac20d5071950fc0c4b5c364a6","collabId":"61c90f6e-a09c-44d3-95db-619b3b3e2587","children":[{"type":"formatted",